    "description": "<p>Collapsing her Essence into pure forward momentum, the martial artist briefly blurs and disappears from sight. This Charm supplements a Dash action, which may not be part of a flurry. The total distance the character travels is quadrupled after all other modifiers, and she cannot be seen or targeted while moving. This Charm's stealth element explicitly fails without provoking a roll-off against effects that would allow others to notice an otherwise perfectly invisible character.</p>",
